# Tauri
frontend/src-tauri/target/
# The compiled backend sidecar (Nuitka, tens of MB) is a BUILD OUTPUT, never source: scripts/build-backend-sidecar.ps1 produces it
# and release builds attach it to GitHub Releases. The folder itself stays (Tauri's externalBin looks for it).
frontend/src-tauri/binaries/*
!frontend/src-tauri/binaries/.gitkeep

